   "id": "root",
   "x": 187,
   "y": 10,
   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Chronic kidney disease (CKD): is it CKD, and how do you SLOW it?",
   "lines": [
    "kidney DAMAGE (protein or blood in the urine) or estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR) < 60 · for ≥ 3 MONTHS · not on dialysis or transplant",
    "causes: #1 diabetes · #2 hypertension · #3 glomerulonephritis · polycystic kidney disease (genetic)",
    "after 40, GFR falls 0.7–1 mL/min a year: judge against age"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 174,
   "w": 1044,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "STAGE it by GFR, % of normal",
   "lines": [
    "1: > 90 · 2: 60–89 · 3: 30–59 · 4: 15–29 · 5: < 15 = KIDNEY FAILURE",
    "below ~25%: POINT OF NO RETURN, it keeps falling even once the insult is gone"
   ]
  },
  {
